&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 18pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 41, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #666e99;&quot;&gt;What Cognite is &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 41, 255);&quot;&gt;Relentless&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 110, 153);&quot;&gt;to Achieve&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Cognite operates at the forefront of industrial digitalization, building AI and data solutions that solve the world’s hardest, highest-impact problems. Our Moonshot is bold: unlock $100B in customer value by 2035, and redefine how global industry works.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;How you’ll demonstrate &lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 41, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ownership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Senior Solutions Architect is responsible for the design of complex end to end solutions, merging our flagship products with the customer&#39;s portfolio, for both new and existing clients. You are a technical subject matter expert in all offerings across the professional and managed services catalog. From discovery through implementation, you will work closely with the sales team and the delivery teams, as well as our data scientists and customers to map out technical requirements and architect robust and familiar solutions. Through your work with our strategic customers, you will identify opportunities for new products and features, and work with our product managers and tech leads to continuously improve Cognite&#39;s SaaS offering.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is a mix of consulting, architecture, and product development in a welcoming cross-functional team. Above all else, we strive to foster a supportive team environment where everyone is excited to share ideas, ask for help, and learn from each other.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;The &lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 41, 255);&quot;&gt;Impact&lt;/span&gt; you bring to Cognite&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;As a Senior Solutions Architect, you will be an expert in how we implement our Cognite SaaS offerings and applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Your primary responsibility will be to work with project teams to map requirements for a quality implementation ensuring that:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The right data visualization technology is used in the right way (E.g Power BI, Grafana, Plotly Dash)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The right data transformation technology is used in the right way (E.g Databricks, Azure, GCP, AWS)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The data is efficiently modeled and contextualized in Cognite Data Fusion (E.g graph and relational)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integrations are well thought out and robustImportant quality criteria for the solution are met (E.g. CI/CD, logging, security)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operational responsibility and support agreements for the delivered solution are clearly defined&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design overall technical solution and ensure technical fit within the customer ecosystem and target architecture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design integration and data model using Cognite data connectors, SQL, Python/Java and Rest APIs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Credible advisor to our customers and partners on Cognite Data Fusion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years experience as an application/data engineer/solution/enterprise architect or Machine learning engineer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Degree in engineering, computer science, physics, or a related quantitative field, or equivalent demonstrated experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hands-on in python as well as a good hands-on expertise with software development best practices.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have a DevOps mindset, and experience with Git, CI/CD, deployment environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with enterprise integration, customer relationships or IT integration design&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with operational data and customer business drivers in the heavy asset industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with a public cloud, preferably AWS, GCP or Azure, including familiarity with network security concepts, identity providers and application hosting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with operations, including support and change control, as well as experience architecting centralized monitoring, logging and reporting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have architectural skills dealing with data modeling and infrastructure solutions, such as classical data warehousing and big data architectures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience from the heavy asset industry (Oil &amp;amp; Gas, Energy, Manufacturing or Pharma) is preferred&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consulting experience that allows you to confidently negotiate requirements with customers and colleague&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A snapshot of our many perks and benefits as a Cogniter&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div&gt;* Join an organization of 60 different nationalities 🌐 with Diversity, Equality and Inclusion (DEI) in focus 🤝&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;* A highly modern and fun working environment with sublime culture across the organization, follow us on Instagram @&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/cognitedata/&quot;&gt;cognitedata&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;📷 to know more&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;* Flat structure with direct access to decision-makers&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;* Opportunity to work with and learn from some of the best people on some of the most ambitious projects found anywhere, across industries, with cutting edge technology&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;* Join our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://hub.cognite.com/&quot;&gt;HUB&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;🗣️ to be part of the conversation directly with Cogniters and our partners.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;* Get access to private health services with Cognite Care.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;* Hungry? We’ve got your back. A subsidized lunch at the canteen is delivered by the chefs at Fornebuporten (Aker Tech House)&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;* Our own&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/p/ClGdwKGK7j7/&quot;&gt;Cognite exclusive coffee bar&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;☕ with the friendliest baristas is here to brew coffee for coffee lovers, tea for tea lovers, smoothie for smoothie lovers, and the baristas creative concoctions when the mood strikes.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;* We take your mental- and physical health seriously by having a broad health offering and a free membership to our fully-staffed gym on-site.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;* A pet lover? Get the chance to meet&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/p/ClljJ29gdk7/&quot;&gt;Spot&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;at the Robot Garden!&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 18pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 41, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #666e99;&quot;&gt;Why Cognite&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work at the forefront of Industrial AI, partnering with some of the world&#39;s leading industrial organisations to solve problems that actually matter at scale — not hypothetical ones. You&#39;ll join a collaborative, fast-moving environment where curiosity and ownership are the norm, not the exception. If you want delivery work you can point to and be proud of, we&#39;d love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Equal Opportunity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Cognite is committed to creating a diverse and inclusive environment at work and is proud to be an equal opportunity employer. All qualified applicants will receive the same level of consideration for employment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join Axon and be a Force for Good.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Axon, we’re on a mission to Protect Life. We’re explorers, pursuing society’s most critical safety and justice issues with our ecosystem of devices and cloud software. Like our products, we work better together. We connect with candor and care, seeking out diverse perspectives from our customers, communities and each other.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Life at Axon is fast-paced, challenging and meaningful. Here, you’ll take ownership and drive real change. Constantly grow as you work hard for a mission that matters at a company where you matter.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Axon&#39;s mission is simple and bold: &lt;strong&gt;Protect Life.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We build technology that helps first responders, security teams and communities act with speed, clarity and confidence in the moments that matter most. Our Real-Time Operations (RTO) portfolio, anchored by the Fusus platform, is transforming how law enforcement, enterprise security and international agencies detect, assess and respond to threats.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fusus connects live video, alerts, sensors and location data into a unified operating picture, and the map is where that picture comes together. It shows where every officer, vehicle, camera, drone and sensor is, what state it is in, and what is happening around it. We&#39;re building a map that stays clear under pressure, so operators and responders can see what matters and act in seconds.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Your Impact&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Senior Product Manager for Maps &amp;amp; Presence, you will define and lead the roadmap for how Fusus shows the world in real time. You&#39;ll own the live map, floor plans and the presence layer: the &quot;dots on the map&quot; that tell operators who and what is where, and whether that information is fresh.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll own the map experience operators use every shift and the map services every other team builds on. Your work will let any device, sensor or data source appear on the map in a consistent way, without bespoke work for each one. That spans body cameras, fleet vehicles, drones, CCTV, sensors and third-party devices, indoors and outdoors.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll also lead the map in Axon&#39;s next generation of Fusus: role-based experiences built from shared components, where every role gets a map designed for its job. Your work will help responders find the nearest resource, follow an incident as it moves and reconstruct what happened afterwards, directly advancing Axon&#39;s mission to Protect Life.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Location: &lt;/strong&gt;This role is based out of our London office and follows a hybrid schedule. We rely on in-person collaboration and ask that team members work onsite Tuesdays through Fridays, with the flexibility to work remotely on Mondays, unless there is an approved workplace accommodation. We believe that connection fuels innovation, and our in-office culture is designed to foster meaningful teamwork, mentorship, and shared success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the Maps &amp;amp; Presence product roadmap, focused on a map that is clear, consistent and fast to act from&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define one behavior model for every real-time dot on the map (how each device type looks, clusters, shows state and freshness) and retire legacy formats&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the map services and contracts (layers, geo-boundaries, floor plans, the Presence API) that let other teams put new data on the map through self-service&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build self-service floor plans and map layers for customer admins, so setup no longer depends on Support or Professional Services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the map and floor-plan components for Fusus&#39;s role-based experiences, shipping them in today&#39;s Fusus first&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver location history (breadcrumbs) and cross-camera tracking for investigations, with Search and video teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with engineering and design to ship responsive, low-latency and reliable map experiences across web and mobile&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage law enforcement and enterprise users in real-time crime centers and the field to validate needs and test improvements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use metrics and feedback to set priorities: dot freshness, map load time, presence coverage, time from alert to action&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support go-to-market, training and rollout with cross-functional teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What Success Looks Like&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operators trust what they see on the map: every device looks and behaves the same way, and stale data is obvious&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;New devices and data sources appear on the map in days, without map-team engineering work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customers set up their own floor plans and layers, and filter the map to what matters to them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adoption grows across customer segments with high daily use, strong retention and positive field feedback&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Every second saved contributes to safer outcomes for officers, teams and the public&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What You Bring&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6–8+ years of product management experience, including 3+ years on map-based, location or real-time products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building products where speed, clarity and reliability directly affect outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong grasp of geospatial and presence concepts: map rendering and clustering, layers and tiles, geofences, indoor mapping, location data quality and freshness&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with live video, sensor networks, fleet or asset tracking, drones and IoT integrations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with platform products that other teams build on, including APIs and data contracts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of turning user insight into clear product direction and focused execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to lead cross-functional teams through roadmap, design, delivery and iteration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear communicator who drives alignment, decisions and measurable outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Why Axon&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape the future of how responders and security teams see and act on the world around them, creating safer outcomes for communities and organisations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Join a mission-driven company with a history of innovation and impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work alongside passionate teams building technology that protects lives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits that Benefit You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive base salary and RSUs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pension plan with matching contributions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private health insurance and cash plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;30 days paid holiday plus UK public holidays&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhanced maternity and paternity leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;GymPass subscription&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life assurance and income protection&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Career growth, learning support, and wellness resources&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Don’t meet every single requirement? That&#39;s ok. At Axon, we Aim Far. We think big with a long-term view because we want to reinvent the world to be a safer, better place. We are also committed to building diverse teams that reflect the communities we serve.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Studies have shown that women and people of color are less likely to apply to jobs unless they check every box in the job description. If you’re excited about this role and our mission to Protect Life but your experience doesn’t align perfectly with every qualification listed here, we encourage you to apply anyways. You may be just the right candidate for this or other roles.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Important Notes&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;The above job description is not intended as, nor should it be construed as, exhaustive of all duties, responsibilities, skills, efforts, or working conditions associated with this job. The job description may change or be supplemented at any time in accordance with business needs and conditions.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Some roles may also require legal eligibility to work in a firearms environment.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We collect personal information from applicants to evaluate candidates for employment. You may request access, deletion, or exercise other CCPA rights at&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link c-link--underline&quot; ----- target=&quot;_blank&quot; ----- ----- via our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link c-link--underline&quot; href=&quot;https://privacyportal.onetrust.com/webform/0efc1702-9321-4119-bc9d-a06c3a1d3e4e/ca57cc26-a159-4193-9f6e-58ffe3fd2509&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://privacyportal.onetrust.com/webform/0efc1702-9321-4119-bc9d-a06c3a1d3e4e/ca57cc26-a159-4193-9f6e-58ffe3fd2509&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Axon Privacy Web Form&lt;/a&gt;. For more information, please see the Your California Privacy Rights section of our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link c-link--underline&quot; href=&quot;https://www.axon.com/candidateprivacypolicy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.axon.com/candidateprivacypolicy&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Applicant and Candidate Privacy Notice.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Axon’s mission is to Protect Life and is committed to the well-being and safety of its employees as well as Axon’s impact on the environment. All Axon employees must be aware of and committed to the appropriate environmental, health, and safety regulations, policies, and procedures. Axon employees are empowered to report safety concerns as they arise and activities potentially impacting the environment.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We are an equal opportunity employer that promotes justice, advances equity, values diversity and fosters inclusion. We’re committed to hiring the best talent — regardless of race, creed, color, ancestry, religion, sex (including pregnancy), national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship status, marital status, disability, gender identity, genetic information, veteran status, or any other characteristic protected by applicable laws, regulations and ordinances — and empowering all of our employees so they can do their best work. If you have a disability or special need that requires assistance or accommodation during the application or the recruiting process, please email &lt;a ---------- &lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;Please note that this email address is for accommodation purposes only. Axon will not respond to inquiries for other purposes.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Phishing alert:&amp;nbsp; Axon will never ask you to pay for any part of the hiring process, including training, equipment, or background checks. We do not make job offers via text message, WhatsApp, or instant messaging platforms without a formal interview process.&amp;nbsp; All legitimate job openings are listed on our official careers page at &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.axon.com/careers&quot;&gt;https://www.axon.com/careers&lt;/a&gt;. &amp;nbsp;If you receive a suspicious offer or outreach from an email address that is not ----- or if you are asked for sensitive personal information (bank details, Social Security Number) prematurely, please ignore the message and report it to &lt;a ----------
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Cato Networks is the converged network and security cloud for the AI era.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:225,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:225,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;As AI reshapes cybersecurity, enterprises face a dual challenge: unlocking AI’s potential while defending against AI-driven attacks. Cato addresses both through a unified, cloud-native platform, providing the visibility and context to prioritize risks and stop threats in real time across users, applications, data, and AI agents.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:225,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:225,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Join us as we scale: take on ambitious technological challenges and shape the next generation of enterprise security at a company trusted by thousands of organizations worldwide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:225,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:225,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;THE OPPORTUNITY&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Cato Networks is building Product-Led Growth capabilities that complement its established enterprise, direct-sales, and partner-led business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a hands-on Product Manager to own product-led customer journeys across Cato’s target markets, with a particular focus on SMB while also improving how larger enterprise customers discover, evaluate, activate, adopt, and expand Cato.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For SMB customers, this may include highly self-service journeys from signup and onboarding through value realization, purchase, and expansion. For larger enterprises, PLG will complement the sales-led motion by helping customers experience value sooner, adopt more effectively, identify expansion opportunities, and create stronger product-qualified demand.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is an individual-contributor role. You will own measurable customer and business outcomes, working directly with Engineering, Design, Data, Marketing, Sales, Channel, Customer Success, and Business Operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and improve the end-to-end PLG journey across relevant customer segments: &lt;strong&gt;discover → evaluate → activate → experience value → adopt → convert → retain → expand&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define segment-specific product-led journeys for SMB and enterprise customers, balancing self-service, sales-assisted, and partner-assisted experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;For SMB, drive simple self-service onboarding, guided configuration, sensible defaults, in-product education, packaging, upgrade paths, and purchase experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;For enterprise customers, identify ways to accelerate evaluation, activation, time-to-value, adoption, product-qualified demand, and expansion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define the key activation and “aha” moments for different customer segments, and improve time-to-first-value and unassisted or assisted activation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own product requirements related to trials, free experiences where relevant, packaging, entitlements, upgrade paths, pricing UX, purchase flows, and conversion triggers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define, instrument, and monitor PLG metrics, including activation, time-to-first-value, product adoption, conversion, product-qualified opportunities, retention, and expansion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use product analytics, customer research, funnel analysis, and experimentation to identify friction, test hypotheses, and continuously improve outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Sales, Marketing, Channel, Customer Success, Finance, and Business Operations to create seamless product-led, sales-assisted, and partner-assisted journeys.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify product-usage and behavioral signals that can trigger contextual recommendations, expansion opportunities, partner engagement, or sales outreach.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
