&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;From a premium gym floor and boutique spin studio to paddle courts, spa facilities and tranquil wellness spaces, every element supports a balanced lifestyle. Members and guests enjoy chef-led, nutritionally considered menus within vibrant social spaces as a space to reset and feel your very best.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.halecountryclub.co.uk/&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;Find out more about Hale Country Club here.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;We are looking for an energetic, passionate, and member-focused &lt;strong&gt;Gym Instructor&lt;/strong&gt; to join the fitness team at Hale Country Club &amp;amp; Spa.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a key part of our wellness offering, you will play an inspiring role in supporting members throughout their fitness journey, delivering exceptional service, expert guidance, and a motivating club experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and support members through our structured 4-week member journey, helping them build confidence, consistency, and results&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Motivate, coach, and energise members during gym sessions and fitness activities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver outstanding member experiences by providing ongoing support, encouragement, and fitness expertise&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build strong relationships with members and help grow and maintain class attendance to support engagement and retention&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver personalised Club Inductions to groups of up to 4 members, ensuring a welcoming and informative onboarding experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain a visible and proactive presence on the gym floor, offering guidance on exercise programmes and safe, effective equipment use&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee daily Gym Floor Operations, including equipment checks, studio preparation, cleanliness standards, maintenance reporting, and health &amp;amp; safety compliance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professionally handle member enquiries, concerns, and feedback when required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;About You:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum &lt;strong&gt;Level 2 Fitness Instructor qualification&lt;/strong&gt; (Level 3 Personal Trainer desirable)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous experience as a Gym Instructor and/or Personal Trainer within a health club, gym, or fitness environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication, interpersonal, and problem-solving skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confident in prescribing and delivering tailored exercise programmes to both new and existing members&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passionate about health, fitness, and delivering exceptional member experiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evidence of continued professional development within the fitness industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Organised, adaptable, and flexible with the ability to work a rota-based schedule&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;What We Offer:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The opportunity to work within a premium health, fitness, and wellness environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ongoing training and development opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunity to complete a &lt;strong&gt;Level 3 Personal Trainer Qualification&lt;/strong&gt; (where applicable)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supportive team culture with opportunities for growth and progression&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THG Ingenuity is proud to be a Disability Confident Committed employer. If you are invited to interview, please let us know if there are any reasonable adjustments we can make to the recruitment process that will enable you to perform to the best of your ability.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THG Ingenuity is committed to creating a diverse &amp;amp; inclusive environment and hence welcomes applications from all sections of the community.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Because of the high volumes of applications our opportunities attract, it sometimes takes us time to review and consider them all. We endeavour to respond to every application we receive within 14 days. If you haven&#39;t heard from us within that time frame or should you have any specific questions about this or other applications for positions at THG Ingenuity please contact one of our &lt;span class=&quot;mark75xs2u5gf&quot; data-markjs=&quot;true&quot; data-ogac=&quot;&quot; data-ogab=&quot;&quot; data-ogsc=&quot;&quot; data-ogsb=&quot;&quot;&gt;Talent&lt;/span&gt; team to discuss further.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;About THG Ingenuity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;THG Ingenuity is a proprietary Software-as-a-Service (SaaS) technology, robotics, and operations platform built for global ecommerce. Developed through more than two decades of operating ecommerce and retail services at scale, its software and automation capabilities have been engineered, tested, and refined through the real-world demands of managing complex commerce operations. Today, THG Ingenuity provides an integrating operating environment that enables brands to intelligently optimise the entire commerce lifecycle from browsing and checkout to AI inventory management and forecasting, automated fulfilment, carrier control, and customer experience. The platform comprises:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;THG Fulfil: The fulfilment operating system for global ecommerce. Delivered via a proprietary SaaS and Robotics-as-a-Service (RaaS) model, THG Fulfil orchestrates every stage of checkout, fulfilment, delivery, and customer experience through an integrated system.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;2&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;THG Studios: The UK&#39;s most innovative creative hub, helping brands create content that connects, experiences that engage, and IP that scales, all from its end-to-end, in-house facilities.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;3&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;THG Commerce: A cloud-native technology stack enabling retailers and brands to create intelligent, AI-powered, digital shopping experiences, while integrated marketplace and social commerce functionality allows brands to reach customers across every sales channel&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;With its expertise in building and scaling brands, THG Ingenuity is uniquely positioned to bring pertinent, pragmatic, and global know-how across all aspects of commerce.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Overview:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;You would be joining a new sales team focussed solely on selling our Fulfilment proposition. This proposition is a key driver in the growth of the wider business meaning you will be able to make a demonstrable impact quickly.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a true hunter role where you would be managing end to end deal processes. The focus is on mid and enterprise level clients looking take products direct to a consumer. You will be armed with one of the strongest Fulfuilment propositions on the market, pushing automation and innovation.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You can find more about our THG Fulfil proposition here: https://www.thgingenuity.com/fulfillment&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyse existing client portfolios to identify revenue growth opportunities.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute strategies to upsell and cross-sell products or services that align with clients&#39; business objectives.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build deep, trusted relationships with key stakeholders within the client base.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a consultant, understanding clients&#39; challenges and aligning solutions to meet their needs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the entire sales process for upselling and cross-selling initiatives, from initial outreach to deal closure.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Achieve and exceed growth and revenue targets for the assigned client base.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with internal teams (e.g., product, marketing, customer success) to ensure a seamless client experience.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gather insights from clients to inform product development and marketing strategies.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively identify areas for improvement and propose solutions that enhance client satisfaction and retention.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reporting &amp;amp; Forecasting:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain accurate records of sales activities and client interactions in CRM tools.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide regular reports and forecasts on revenue growth performance and pipeline health.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Potential to grow into leadership role&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record in a growth-focused sales role within Fulfilment or Logistics sales (Can be SaaS or Logistics solutions, we are keen to find fulfilment experts)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong consultative sales skills with the ability to uncover client needs and align them with solutions.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional communication, negotiation, and presentation skills.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analytical mindset with the ability to identify growth opportunities through data-driven insights.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with CRM tools (e.g., Salesforce, HubSpot) and sales analytics platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A team player with a collaborative approach and a client-first attitude&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THG Ingenuity is proud to be a Disability Confident Committed employer. If you are invited to interview, please let us know if there are any reasonable adjustments we can make to the recruitment process that will enable you to perform to the best of your ability.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
